id: undying-determination-mark
name: Undying Determination
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Undying Determination (2)'s, on your clock till the end of your next turn - your Life Points held 1
# above their least meanwhile (dbu-ttrpg.mjs) - and (3) as it ends.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Undying Determination: Life Points held 1 above their least, no Health Threshold penalties; at the end of your next turn,
  your Life Points to their least and Defeated.
text: >
  Undying Determination (2): until the end of your next turn, your Life Points cannot be reduced below that value and you may
  ignore all Health Threshold penalties. (3): at the end of your next turn, your Life Points are reduced to their lowest
  possible value and you are Defeated.

---

[passive]
threshold.penalty = 0;

# (3)
[on removed]
undyingEnds();
